From 90a75bf699c521cbc066e1ec9ca627ae9e4f06fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 19:52:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Night safety: bedtime, a watch rota with an alarm, the camp
 rally, a sword for Sage

From a recorded two-day Hardcore run: friends hardly slept (bedtime scored 45-55
against camp work at 60-130), Aegis went to bed at midnight and then fought two
zombies alone (the second killed him), and Sage, with nothing to fight with,
could only run.

- Bedtime: at night the scheduler offers only needs jobs and NIGHT_JOBS (coming
  home, the watch, Aegis's guard and gear, Terra lighting a dark camp, feeding a
  hurt friend or hungry player, restocking a weapon or food, idling) and puts any
  other job down at nightfall. Sleep scores 75-82 at night, above pastimes, chats
  and warming up; supper and (without a cabin) warming up by the fire come first.
  Terra's lighting scores 80 at night so a dark camp is lit before she sleeps.
- Watch rota (camp/NightWatch): first watch dusk to midnight, second midnight to
  dawn. Aegis keeps the first when fit; any other watch goes to a friend with a
  tool to fight with, ranked healthy, not on watch last night (rotation), best
  weapon, health, roster order. A watcher who dies, leaves, gets too weak or too
  tired is relieved; a lone friend keeps no watch. Remembered in CampData
  memory; watchers nap sooner next day. WatchTask keeps watch by the campfire;
  GuardTask is Aegis's watch only while it is his watch.
- Alarm: the awake watcher spots hostiles inside the camp (seen, within 12, or
  attacking someone), shouts ALARM; a new alarm wakes every sleeper in the camp
  and armed friends go for the alarmed hostiles. A sleeper is woken for their
  own watch.
- Rally: inside the camp armed friends join a fight for anyone within 16 blocks
  and need no line of sight (they path to it; Aegis too); meleeReach is 24 for an
  armed friend or the watcher in camp. Unreachable hostiles are skipped, and a
  target neither hit nor hitting for 10 s out of reach is given up for 30 s.
  Root-caused flake: a friend not yet landed has no path, which no longer
  counts a hostile as unreachable.
- Sage starts with a wooden sword; a sword is the strategist's role tool
  (KeepList, RestockTask, CraftToolTask).
- NIGHT_WATCH and ALARM lines in every friend's voice.
- Docs: GUIDE (new section 6, Nights), DESIGN, DEVELOPING, README.
- NightGameTest (solo_161..168): bedtime beats building, second watch while
  Aegis sleeps, rota without Aegis, rally from 12 blocks round a wall, alarm
  wakes a sleeper, Sage's sword, and two whole nights (with and without Aegis).

